<mxCell id="note1" value="Notes:&lt;br&gt;&#8226; No po_number / so_number columns exist anywhere &#8212; orders are identified by numeric id + note/status/dates.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; stock_ledger.qty is signed (no CHECK constraint): +N for Receipt, -N for Issue, either for Adjustment.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; event_logs is a separate, general activity log &#8212; NOT a replacement for stock_ledger, which remains the sole source of truth for stock movements. event_logs is schema-only as of 2026-09-18 (not yet wired to any Controller/Service).&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Dashed-border boxes = supporting/bonus tables, not part of the 12 core domain entities.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Dashed lines = nullable FK. Lines via the right-side channel = master-data FK that skips straight into Purchasing/Sales/event_logs.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Source of truth: database/schema.sql (verified 2026-09-18)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1310" width="820" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
